  },
  "publishedAt": "2023-03-16T15:13:00.000Z",
  "excerpt": "Admizz Education brings you exciting news for students seeking to Study Abroad in Australia! The Australian government is implementing changes [&hellip;]",
  "content": [
    {
      "_key": "e0b279168195",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3dedfd3ca3a6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Admizz Education"
        },
        {
          "_key": "39e20b7c4e0c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " brings you exciting news for students seeking to Study Abroad in Australia! The Australian government is implementing changes to their student visa process, aiming to streamline the application experience and prioritize Genuine Students seeking quality education."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6d09ca54d417",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "abc8e164e05c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Key points to remember:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4a9ef1dd23f2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "01133ccc2b78",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Genuine Student Requirement: From March 23rd, 2024, a new “Genuine Student” (GS) requirement will replace the existing “Genuine Temporary Entrant” (GTE) for student visa applications."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "24151eb0c1df",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a4b9a659750e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Focus on Educational Goals: The visa assessment will prioritize your study plans, reasons for choosing Australia, and ties to your home country, emphasizing genuine educational aspirations."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "83f44ca1ce7f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c4708beb97b4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Targeted Application Questions: Application forms will have new questions designed to understand your study choices, motivations for selecting Australia, and your current life situation."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "573224cd5a33",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7d793a1f573b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Student Declaration: Applicants will be required to confirm their understanding of visa conditions, including limited post-study migration options."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "123df83e45e6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "050d69033b16",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "What this means for you:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e5f21d7e97e8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "74672f71e292",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Clearer Focus: The emphasis is now on demonstrating your genuine interest in pursuing a quality education in Australia."
